							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=510771" target="_blank">Faelin</a> and <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=866640" target="_blank">Faeleth</a><br /><img src="http://home.satx.rr.com/pwidsten/sotf2.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><a href="http://www.brewmasters.org/" target="_blank">Brew Masters</a></div>
