	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12931"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=961" title="View the profile of AverseThule">AverseThule</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/evildude.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								&lt;Oggok Foreign Legion&gt;<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=961"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1201.msg12931#msg12931"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1201.msg12931#msg12931">Re: Christmas Contest</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> December 04, 2004, 02:51:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Catcher in the Rye?<br /><br />Interesting storyline here:<br /><br /><span style="font-size: 7pt;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">But there’s more:  a shadowknight from &lt;Theft of Life&gt; apparently ninjalooted a Ring of Destruction from WoW’s AoW kill.  There was a big controversy about this, and it must have been all over Flamevault.  The “time limit” and the ninjalooting together made this an unforgettable—not exactly in a good way—raid.  I guess the platitude “two wrongs don’t make a right” applies here, and the ninjalooter was removed from the guild.  Everyone learned their lesson; two lessons, in fact: be competitive, but not mean, and don’t retaliate against anything with foul play</div></span><br /><br /><span style="font-size: 7pt;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Then, last August, just when we were tired of BoT towers and looking for something else to do, Riake from &lt;Century of Flame&gt; approached me with the idea of an alliance to work on PoP progression.  I agreed, and this began the “modern era” of my guild, so to speak, the era of raiding for progression. </div> </span> <br /><br />Riake = your ninjalooter!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://members.cox.net/aversethule/aversesig.jpg" alt="" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
